// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_cart_setexp, hol_real_R)
Theorem DENSE_LIMIT_POINTS : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall s c= R :^: idx N, {x :e R :^: idx N | limit_point_of N x s} = R :^: idx N <-> closure N s = R :^: idx N.
Admitted.

