// Source hash: md5:f9715348ff23cdd9b2a15eb68165918b
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_cart_setexp, hol_real_R)
Theorem CONNECTED_EQ_CONNECTED_COMPONENTS_EQ : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall s c= R :^: idx A, connected A s <-> forall c c' c= R :^: idx A, c :e components A s /\ c' :e components A s -> c = c'.
Admitted.

