Theorem POSITIVE_SEMIDEFINITE_DIAGONAL_INEQUALITY : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall A :e R :^: idx N :^: idx N, forall i j :e omega, positive_semidefinite N A /\ (1 <= i /\ (i <= dimindex N /\ (1 <= j /\ j <= dimindex N))) -> A i j ^ 2 <= A i i * A j j.
Admitted.

