Theorem TRACE_MUL_POSITIVE_SEMIDEFINITE_LE : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall A B :e R :^: idx N :^: idx N, positive_semidefinite N A /\ positive_semidefinite N B -> trace N (matrix_mul N N N A B) <= trace N A * trace N B.
Admitted.

