Theorem POSITIVE_DEFINITE_MUL_EQ : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall A B :e R :^: idx N :^: idx N, positive_definite N A /\ positive_definite N B -> (positive_definite N (matrix_mul N N N A B) <-> matrix_mul N N N A B = matrix_mul N N N B A).
Admitted.

