// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_cart_setexp, hol_num_omega, hol_one_1, hol_real_R, hol_tybit_idx, omega_Subq_R)
Theorem POSITIVE_SEMIDEFINITE_2_DET : forall A :e R :^: idx_n 2 :^: idx_n 2, positive_semidefinite (idx_n 2) A <-> symmetric_matrix_hl (idx_n 2) A /\ (0 <= A 1 1 /\ (0 <= A 2 2 /\ 0 <= det (idx_n 2) A)).
Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/topology.ml:21056 / POSITIVE_SEMIDEFINITE_2
