Theorem POSITIVE_SEMIDEFINITE_2 : forall A :e R :^: idx_n 2 :^: idx_n 2, positive_semidefinite (idx_n 2) A <-> A 2 1 = A 1 2 /\ (0 <= A 1 1 /\ (0 <= A 2 2 /\ A 1 2 ^ 2 <= A 1 1 * A 2 2)).
Admitted.

